OL,3,AEgypt court fines journalist Lina
OL,4,AAttalah and orders news site's closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe editor-in-chief of the independent
OL,7,FEgyptian news outlet Mada Masr was
OL,8,Fdetained for several hours after a
OL,9,Fcourt convicted her of managing an
OL,10,Funlicensed website and ordered its
OL,11,Fclosure, her lawyers say.
OL,13,FMada Masr said Lina Attalah was
OL,14,Freleased once it paid the fine of 3m
OL,15,FEgyptian pounds ($53,500; #40,100) also
OL,16,Fhanded down to her by the New Cairo
OL,17,FMisdemeanours Court. It was the maximum
OL,18,Fpossible penalty for the charge, which
OL,19,Fshe had rejected.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
