OL,3,AEgypt court fines journalist Lina
OL,4,AAttalah and orders news site's closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmnesty International said the verdict
OL,7,Frepresented "a crushing blow to press
OL,8,Ffreedom".
OL,10,FIt comes only weeks after six
OL,11,Fjournalists working for the independent
OL,12,Ffact-checking platform Matsda2sh were
OL,13,Fcharged with belonging to the outlawed
OL,14,FMuslim Brotherhood.
